<title>CHILE: Chile's Soquimich 9-mo net rises.</title>
<headline>Chile's Soquimich 9-mo net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fertilizer producer Sociedad Quimica y Minera de Chile SA (Soquimich)  SQM.SN reported the following consolidated results in the first nine months of this year.</p>
<p>			     9-mo 1996	   9-mo 1995</p>
<p>Net earnings		US$52.65	  US$33.49</p>
<p>Operating profit	     56.30	     36.00</p>
<p>Non-operating profit	 N/A		  N/A</p>
<p>Total sales		   346.50	     312.20</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in millions of dollars.</p>
<p>-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595 x212</p>
</text>
